    title: "verify-claims verdicts carry no analysis-fidelity provenance: a tree-sitter verdict and a SCIP verdict are byte-identical (closes the second half of the INV-fibis/INV-nuhun bar)"  # 90a1
    status: todo_hard  # 90a1
    priority: 1  # 90a1
    parent:  # 90a1
