  message: "OWNER RULING 2026-08-23 (full text on INV-polad): \"declare the blindness, do those 4 PRs.\" Kotlin and JavaScript get a DATED DECLARED-BLINDNESS residual now rather than waiting on WI-nasuf, so a later WI-nasuf fix flips a declaration instead of turning this invariant red. Closure path is PR1 call_construct parity -> PR2 declared blindness -> PR3 denylist disclosure -> PR4 fidelity provenance, then close on behavioral evidence. Measured basis: 786 of 954 method-kind sinks (82%) are in languages where the untyped-receiver disclosure cannot fire today (~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/disclosure_parity_08232026/)."  # 321b
