  message: "SHIPPED as PR #501 (envelope 2.2). Verdict carries analysis_fidelity (language -> pass IDs behind its CALL edges) and a higher_fidelity_available caveat for a backend installed-but-not-run. Measured: same rust crate, backend OFF -> fidelity {rust:[rust]} + caveat; backend ON -> caveat gone. The two arms are no longer byte-identical, which was this item's filed defect. A first cut keyed 'did it run' on the call-edge map and told a reader to enable a backend that was already running (SCIP emitted references/contains, no external calls); passes_that_ran now answers that from every edge, pinned by a test."  # f849
